message: "If you use AGON in research, evaluation, or derivative work, please cite this repository."
title: "AGON: Source-Grounded Conflict Perception"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Giulio
    family-names: Catanzariti
    affiliation: TACITUS
    email: hello@tacitus.me
repository-code: "https://github.com/sargonxg/AGON"
url: "https://www.tacitus.me"
abstract: >-
  AGON is an experimental Rust research system for representing actors, claims,
  interests, constraints, leverage, commitments, events, narratives,
  contradictions, friction signals, source spans, and provenance in difficult
  human and institutional text.
keywords:
  - conflict analysis
  - policy analysis
  - provenance
  - knowledge graphs
  - human review
  - Rust
